Design inspiration
-------------------
Several architectural ideas in this project -- most notably TOML-based
project configuration and bilingual (side-by-side) PDF output -- were
inspired by BabelDOC (https://github.com/funstory-ai/BabelDOC), an
AGPL-3.0-licensed scientific-PDF translation tool. No BabelDOC source code
is included in or derived into this project; this is an acknowledgement of
design influence, not a statement of shared code or license terms.
